# TR Necrom: "A Broken Family" (TR_m2_Nm_BrokenFamily), the peaceful ending. The vampire Velyn Alari in the Sadalvel
# Ancestral Tomb asks the player to carry a letter to his brother ("Adren Alari": "Yes, I will deliver the message for
# you." 2: 10). Adren in the Necrom Temple Library hears he is alive (1), gets the letter (2), Continue (4), refuses
# to have him killed (6, then "You should not kill Velyn." 8: 30) and leaves for the tomb (TR_m2_Nm_BrokenFamilyScript
# moves him on the next cell change). There he force-greets the player; speechcraft 50 or more (set as a stand-in by
# the Tel Mora case) unlocks "talk to each other" (11: 50). Velyn, asked again, makes peace (Continue 8: 190).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_nm_drunk_shirt --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case nm_brokenfamily_start
run
player->PositionCell 5277 4800 14535 0 "Sadalvel Ancestral Tomb"
until 600 "TR_m2_Velyn Alari"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Velyn Alari
ask Adren Alari
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_BrokenFamily == 10
expect player->GetItemCount "TR_m2_BrokenFamily_Message" == 1
bye
end

case nm_brokenfamily_adren
run
player->PositionCell 3550 4400 14886 0 "Necrom, Temple Library"
until 600 "TR_m2_Adren Alari"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Adren Alari
ask Velyn Alari
choose 1
choose 2
choose 4
choose 6
choose 8
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_BrokenFamily == 30
bye
end

case nm_brokenfamily_tomb
run
player->PositionCell 5277 4500 14535 0 "Sadalvel Ancestral Tomb"
until 600 "TR_m2_Adren Alari"->GetDistance player < 2000
wait 60
run
player->PositionCell 5268 4700 14535 0 "Sadalvel Ancestral Tomb"
until 600 "TR_m2_Adren Alari".sayGreeting == 1
choose 11
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_BrokenFamily == 50
bye
end

case nm_brokenfamily_done
talk TR_m2_Velyn Alari
ask Adren Alari
choose 8
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_BrokenFamily == 190
bye
end
